[<TXT>Organic granular fertilizer [ <MET>[_____] kg per square meter</MET><ENG>[_____] pounds per acre</ENG>] [ <MET>[_____] kg per 100 square meters</MET><ENG>[_____] pounds per 1000 square 
feet</ENG>].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]<BRK/>
